@startuml state-reservation
title Reservation Lifecycle (cumulative through Iteration 3) - State Pattern
hide empty description
skinparam stateFontSize 12
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130

[*] -down-> Initiated
Initiated -right-> PassengerInfoEntered : enterPassengerInfo()
PassengerInfoEntered -right-> PendingPayment : processPayment()
PendingPayment -right-> Confirmed : payment authorized
PendingPayment -down-> Cancelled : handlePaymentFailure()
Confirmed -right-> Ticketed : issueTicket()
Confirmed -down-> CancellationRequested : requestCancellation()
Ticketed -down-> CancellationRequested : requestCancellation()
CancellationRequested -left-> Cancelled : confirmCancellation()
Cancelled -down-> RefundRequested : requestRefund()
RefundRequested -right-> Refunded : processRefundDecision()
Refunded -right-> [*]

note right of Cancelled
  Iter3 entry sources (Observer):
   - PendingPayment -> Cancelled is
     triggered by ReservationAutoCancelListener
     on PaymentFailedEvent
   - PendingPayment -> Cancelled is also
     triggered by ReservationHoldListener
     on SeatHoldExpiredEvent
end note
@enduml
